OL,3,GNEWSANationalising rail operator a
OL,4,A'significant milestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBringing a rail operator back into
OL,7,Fpublic ownership after 30 years will
OL,8,Fsave money and provide a better
OL,9,Fservice, a minister has said.
OL,11,FChiltern Railways will become the 10th
OL,12,Frail company to be nationalised on
OL,13,FSunday under Great British Railways
OL,14,F(GBR), the government's programme of
OL,15,Fpublic ownership.
OL,17,FRail minister Lord Peter Hendy met
OL,18,Fstaff at Marylebone Station on Thursday
OL,19,Falongside the first Chiltern train to
OL,20,Fget the new GBR livery.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
